# Copy to .env and fill in. The demo agent uses the Anthropic Messages API.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the default model.
CELLARIUM_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5
# HF raw downloads are ON by default (the raw corpus is uploaded). Set to 0 to force regenerate-locally instead.
# CELLARIUM_HF_HAS_RAW=0

# The model image the corpus READERS run in. Without this (and without WCECOLI_DIR), every tool that
# reads a simulation falls back to running the worker natively, which needs `wholecell` importable on
# the host — so they fail with `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'wholecell'`. MEASURED 2026-08-11:
# a live Cellwright turn asked for a transcript half-life, `deg_rate_provenance` errored exactly this
# way, and the agent could only report that it could not answer. `.claude/launch.json` does not set it,
# so a server started from that config has every simOut-reading tool broken.
#
# NAME THE BUILD, NOT A TAG YOU MADE ONCE. `docs/DOCKER_SETUP.md` says to run
# `docker tag "${USER}-wcm-code" wcecoli-sim`, and `docker tag` is a SNAPSHOT POINTER: rebuilding
# ${USER}-wcm-code does not move it. MEASURED 2026-08-24 — `wcecoli-sim:latest` on this machine was tagged
# 2026-05-10 and never re-pointed, so it matched Cellarium's overlay on 3 of 45 files while
# `cellarium-wcm-code:latest` (rebuilt 2026-08-03) matched 43. It was MISSING graded_gene_knockout.py and
# multi_gene_knockout.py, which 24 corpus rows use — those runs are impossible on it. Every simulation
# launched from this machine was running a 3.5-month-old model and nothing could report it, because the
# manifest has no populated image_digest column. Point this at the build itself.
# Use the image `cloud/build-containers-locally.sh` produced: ${USER}-wcm-code:latest with ${USER}
# RESOLVED to your login name. Do NOT leave a literal ${USER} on the line below: python-dotenv DOES
# expand it, and on Windows `USER` is unset (only `USERNAME` is), so it silently becomes
# `-wcm-code:latest` — the same empty-$USER trap that makes `docker build -t` read the leading dash
# as a flag. Write the resolved name.
WCECOLI_DOCKER=YOUR_LOGIN_NAME-wcm-code:latest
# Native fallback instead: leave WCECOLI_DOCKER unset and point WCECOLI_DIR at a wcEcoli checkout.
# WCECOLI_DIR=/path/to/wcEcoli
